==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|osp|lançar}}, from {{inh|es|LL.|lanceo|lanceō, lanceāre}}, derived from {{der|es|la|lancea||spear}}, of {{der|es|xce|-}} origin. Compare {{cog|ca|llançar}}, {{cog|ast|llanzar}}, {{cog|fr|lancer}}, {{cog|it|lanciare}}, {{cog|oc|-}} and {{cog|pt|lançar}}, {{cog|en|launch}}. {{doublet|es|lancear}}, a later borrowing.

